    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Examination Board (AKU-EB) held a six-day workshop in Karachi to develop AKU-EB's HSSC examinations syllabi, based on the National Curriculum 2002 and 2006. Professors and lecturers of affiliated HSSC colleges from Lahore, Rawalpindi Murree, Chakwal, Mianwali, Karachi, Hyderabad, Dharki, Gilgit, Hunza and Gahkuch participated in the workshop.",
